Package: libva-v4l2
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: va-driver
Description: VA-API backend for Qualcomm Iris stateful V4L2 devices
 Hardware video decoding and H.264/HEVC encoding through the Qualcomm Iris
 stateful V4L2 M2M interface. This experimental driver targets SC8280XP,
 including Radxa Dragon Q8B, and requires a compatible kernel and firmware.
 .
 Includes the MSM driver alias and GStreamer VA environment configuration.
 FastCV video processing is disabled in distribution builds.
